  "embeddingEncoder.encode": "internal: true did not gate the mount (see the 2026-08-26 note on data-store-provider) — every method below was reachable on the AppRouter by ANY authenticated session at the default auth: 'protected'. Consumers reach the encoder via ctx.api from addon-post-analysis, never tRPC.",
  "embeddingEncoder.encodeText": "modelId (a CLIP IMAGE model id, whose catalog clip.textModelId names the text tower) encodes in that model's space; absent, the cluster row's clip-embedding model — the space every writer is in (D649).",
  "embeddingEncoder.getInfo": "Answers for ONE node — the nodeId selector's, else the hub's.",
  "embeddingEncoder.resetFailedModels": "The operator's explicit clear of the failed state (one model, or all) on ONE node — pass nodeId for an agent; the result names the node it cleared. The only way out besides a model change: a crashing tower is not retried on a timer.",
