  "failureContribution.list": "This addon's per-camera failure counters, read live from bounded in-RAM state it already keeps. Inert: no persistence, no sampling, no timer.",
  "fanControl.getStatus": "The device's current status as reported by this capability; null when unknown.",
  "fanControl.setDirection": "Set the fan rotation direction.",
  "fanControl.setOscillating": "Turn oscillation on or off.",
  "fanControl.setOscillationAxis": "Sets one oscillation axis: its switch, fixed angle and/or sweep bounds. Fields left out are untouched. A field linked in Customize is forwarded to its linked source (D1034); otherwise the native provider serves it; neither → axis-not-linked. Ranges are checked against the axis limits before anything is written; writes run in order and stop at the first failure, which the result names.",
  "fanControl.setPercentage": "Set the fan speed from 0 to 100.",
  "fanControl.setPreset": "Set the fan preset mode.",
  "fanPresets.applyPreset": "Apply a saved preset to the fan.",
  "fanPresets.capturePreset": "The fan's CURRENT fan-control state as a preset: the fields named in fields (all when absent), read from its merged slice — a field linked in Customize reads its link. A reading that is unknown is left out and named in omitted, never captured as 0. Nothing is saved.",
  "fanPresets.getPresets": "The fan's saved presets.",
