  "heroLayout.getLayout": "The fixed rows of a kind: the type, refined by the role (D1033 — a heater is a switch).",
  "heroLayout.getRowModels": "The list rows of many devices in ONE call, projected from the same model as the hero. One entry per requested id, in order. null has two meanings, both \"no row\": the registry does not know the device, or reading it failed (the provider logs that, tagged). It is never an empty row.",
  "humidifier.getStatus": "The device's current status as reported by this capability; null when unknown.",
