  "metricsProvider.listNodeProcesses": "Snapshot of every camstack-related process on this node with a root/managed/system classification. Powers the Cluster → Agent → Processes tab: cross-references $process.list against a ps scan so per-addon CPU and RSS can be attributed, and so a process the cluster does not manage is still visible.",
  "migrations.clearLegacyIntegrationRows": "Migration-only. Delete that integration's rows. The caller releases the keychain values first. secrets is how many marker refs the rows held. A missing store deletes nothing. Deleted with the last copy migration.",
  "migrations.declareOwner": "An ADDON offers its catalogue at its own boot (D987 M3). The engine checks it together with every other owner's, takes the pre-migration snapshot of each file a pending migration touches, and answers the owner's steps in the order the framework decides. A catalogue the engine refuses (a cycle, a foreign owner, a body kind the owner cannot run) is refused whole and writes nothing.",
