  "migrations.markFailed": "Record a failure the engine could not see itself (a runner that gave up).",
  "migrations.patchLegacyIntegrationRows": "Migration-only. Upsert the given keys and leave every other key as stored. written is false when the store is gone. Deleted with the last copy migration.",
  "migrations.readLegacyIntegrationRows": "Migration-only. The stored rows of one integration, markers included, on the settings connection. Empty when the store is gone — a copy migration on a node that already dropped it is a no-op. Deleted with the last copy migration. Not a settings API.",
