  "recordingArchive.deleteFootprint": "Manually delete a camera's footage — the whole footprint, or a [fromMs, toMs) window when either bound is given. Logged to the recordings ops-log as op:'manual-delete', reason:'manual'. Destructive: the admin UI guards it behind a confirm.",
