  "recordingArchive.renderClip": "Render a short MP4 clip from recorded footage around aroundMs — the \"send a clip, not a gif\" notification attachment. Same window, source and fail-closed contract as {@link renderGif}: no footage covering the window ⇒ it throws and the caller ships no attachment. Re-encoded (never stream-copied) so a concat across segments with different encoder parameters still plays. Silent by contract.",
