  "serverManagement.setLaunchOverrides": "Set or clear (null) the node's heap-ceiling (heapMb) and hub-main RSS budget (rssBudgetMb) overrides; the budget wins over its env. It is written on the node itself and applies at the NEXT launch — restart the node (restartServer) for it to take effect.",
  "settingsStore.aggregate": "COUNT(*) and one SUM / MIN / MAX per requested field, in ONE statement, over the rows filter selects.",
  "settingsStore.count": "Count entries in a collection, optionally filtered.",
  "settingsStore.declareCollection": "Declare a typed (SQL-backed) collection with explicit columns + indexes. Idempotent: re-declaring an existing collection with the same shape is a no-op; shape changes (new columns, new indexes) are applied additively. Subsequent insert / update / delete / query calls on this collection use typed columns instead of JSON-blob storage — record.data fields are spread across columns, query.filter.where matches real columns (no json_extract overhead), orderBy uses column indexes.",
  "settingsStore.delete": "Delete a record by key/ID.",
