  "streamBroker.getStreamWithCodec": "Shared codec-targeted stream API — see Task #184. THE single public stream-acquisition surface for programmatic consumers: single-dial (rides the broker's one source pull) and passthrough-correct (videoCodec:'auto' → -c copy, never a needless re-encode). Resolution order: source-select → HW transcode → libx264/libx265.",
